    "turn_text": "maha. Don't you think? All right, comment to Doug's, what do we got? This is from Barch. I think Doge needs to take a look at entitlements, especially means-tested entitlements, the amount of grift, epidemic, endemic to entitlements is probably the location of significant savings within the federal budget.",
