        "text": "Current fiscal policy cannot achieve a balanced budget without fundamental structural changes.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Economic growth alone is insufficient to resolve long-term fiscal imbalances.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The public commonly overestimates the impact of eliminating inefficiencies on the deficit.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker’s argument is grounded in realistic, non-hypothetical fiscal projections.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
